      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name} I should reasonable expect it to update in real-time whenever someone updates their status, not only after I visit their main menu profile. Currently as it goes, I'll browse my social menu and see that someone is on orange for example, but when I bring up their profile, it'll suddenly switch them to green. This also causes issues if someone was previously on red as you wouldn't be able to send a req or inv until showing their profile, thus seeing their status update to say green.\n\n>> How quickly does it update right now? In VRChat? In external apps?\n\nIn VRChat, like I mentioned, statuses don't really seem to update until you open someone's profile in the main menu or change locations. In VRCX it's sort of the same really. Statuses don't really seem to update at all unless I view someone's profile in the app unless I bring up their profile which makes a call to update the information. That or clicking this button in VRCX which makes a call to refresh my entire friends list social presence.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
