      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5ca74f3fb98a820b3ffec9cf|full_name} Try using Cloudflare WARP as a VPN to see if it reproduces with that on. It sounds like it could possibly be a broken websocket connection.\n\nI've received guidance that disabling IPv6 can help, it didn't in my case, but the Cloudflare tip did solve it pretty much completely - at the cost of requiring me to route all my traffic through that VPN while I am playing or intend to play VRChat.\n\nIf this is a broken websocket connection then perhaps this could be addressed in part by VRChat improving their code to recover from broken websocket connections.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
