      "mergedPostDetails": "1. Play the game for some time\n\n2. Go on your friends location tab and look for friends in privat worlds. \n\n3. Check there Status before (Screenshot 1) - orange in private\n\n4. Check the Profile (Screenshot 2) - green in joinable world\n\n5. Check there Status after (Screenshot 3) - green in private\n\nWebsite and VRCX showing same informations as in Screenshot 2\n\nThis is one example of hundrets of this situations. This is a fearly common issue I'm facing in the last time.",
